      299.83,
      83.79,
      307.58,
      491.8
    ],
    "text": "Report of the Auditor General:\u2013Review Report on the Balance Sheet of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka as at 30th September, 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      277.03,
      209.79,
      293.18,
      717.9
    ],
    "text": "I have reviewed the accompanying Balance Sheet of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka (CBSL) as at 30th September, 2016. This Balance Sheet is the Responsibility of the Management ofthe Central Bank of Sri Lanka. My responsibility is to issue a report on this balance sheet based on my reveiw.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      243.43,
      209.79,
      267.98,
      717.9
    ],
    "text": "I conducted my review in accordance with Sri Lanka Standards on Review Engagements 2400 applicable to Review Engagements. This Standard requires that the review should beplanned and performed to obtain moderate assurance as to whether the Balance Sheet is free of material misstatements. The review is limited primarily to inquiries of personnel of theCBSL and analytical procedures applied to financial data and thus provide less assurance than an audit.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      226.63,
      209.79,
      234.38,
      640.45
    ],
    "text": "Based on my review, nothing has come to my attention that causes me to believe that the accompanying Balance Sheet does not give a true and fair view.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      189.43,
      83.79,
      205.58,
      663.39
    ],
